WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You play a police officer
in this film.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
-Based on the clip,

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
you do not possess
great intelligence.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-No.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:10.243
My niche is an actor is to play
very stupid people.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah. I'll take it.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Does this -- Now, there are
two kinds of stupid.

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:16.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's stupid with awareness
that they're stupid,

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then stupid without.
Is this --

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.086 line:92%
-I specialize in without.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, that's too stupid

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:23.590 line:92%
to even know they're stupid.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, like you mentioned
"Baby Mama."

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:26.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So the difference between

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:29.429
this character and "Baby Mama"
is I have a mustache in this.

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:30.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.132 line:92%
-Yeah, and a different shirt.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like I wore a lot of flannel
shirts in "Baby Mama",

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
and here I'm obviously
in some kind of municipality.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know what that is,
but, yeah.

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:42.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You -- one of your --
-Are you impressed

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
with that mustache?
-It is a good mustache.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it your own?
-It is my own.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And I got to say,

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.516 line:92%
I was nervous while growing it

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
that it would be
less than powerful.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then when I saw the movie
for the first time

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:55.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
a couple weeks ago --
-It's great.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.757 line:92%
-It's a very powerful mustache.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.193
[ Laughter ]
-Is that -- in your illustrious

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:02.562
career, is that the first time
you've grown your own mustache

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
for a role?
-It is.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-And I very much wanted --

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been looking forward,
hoping --

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
Certain dreams have gone away.
-Yeah.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm not going to get hired
to play a superhero.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:12.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You think that window
is closed?

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.440 line:92%
-I had always secretly thought,

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
"oh God, I hope I get
hired to play a superhero.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can do steroids."
-Yeah.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And --
-I'd like to try it as a man.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-But have an excuse.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:25.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm a father of two. I can't
just do steroids for fun.

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:28.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But for several million
dollars...

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.190 line:92%
-Yeah, you would do steroids.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.025 line:92%
-I can do it. Yeah, yeah.

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:35.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or like a coke addict.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.729 line:92%
-You want to play a coke addict?

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:39.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I mean, I've been sober
for 13 years.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:42.836
But I feel like if, like,
Scorsese calls and says,

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.270 line:92%
"I got this great role for you.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just got to huff
a lot cocaine."

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:47.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I'd have to do it.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.109 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I bet they use prop cocaine.
I feel like --

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not Scorsese.
-Yeah. That's true.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-No, come on.

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:57.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe Spielberg,
but not Scorsese.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, so, then you got to
do the mustache.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:00.186 line:92%
Did you have enough time?

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:01.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like when you got offered
the part to when you

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:02.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
started shooting,
were you worried

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:03.690 line:92%
it was too small a window?

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:06.626
-I was. In fact, it's a little,
how do we say,

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:10.230
inconsistent because it was
growing as we were filming.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ah.
-So there are some scenes

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:13.233 line:92%
where it's a proper womb broom.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And then there are others

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:17.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
where it's more just like
a pre-teen.

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:18.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Got it.
-Right. But funny enough,

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.808
the whole reason I'm in the
movie is that Vincent D'Onofrio

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.910
who's also in the movie,
much better actor than me.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fantastic actor.
I would say even,

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:27.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
but he's a fantastic actor.
-Yeah, one of the best.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-One of the greats.

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
Gets to play smart people
all the time.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
They always hire him for that.
He texts me,

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:35.655 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, we're starting a movie
in two weeks,"

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
because he read the script.
He said,

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This guy's dumb,
got to get Dax."

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:40.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He told the director.
He said,

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:44.297 line:92%
"Yeah, he's as dumb as it gets."

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:44.831 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.033 size:84% position:42%
And it was, you know --
so it just happened.

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.335 size:88% position:44%
Like, D'Onofrio actually
cast me in this movie.

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:50.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's great.
-And then he said,

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:51.704 line:92%
"I'm growing a mustache for it."

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:53.840
And I said,
"Well, then I'm going to, too."

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
And just to kind of mess
with him,

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.178 line:92%
and, you know, here we have it.

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's fantastic.
-Yeah.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
The movie's called
"Mustache Christmas" --

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Please check it out

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:04.350 size:88% position:44% line:92%
December 8th on Netflix.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And its --
You play two police officers,

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:08.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
but your mustaches
solve the crime.

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're just, like, there.
-That's right. That's right.

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:11.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
-I want to talk --

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.660 size:78% position:39%
-Like the tea leaves.
I put dust in them.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:17.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I start
connecting the dots.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
Genius mustache.
-At one point there's yarn.

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:22.302 size:84% position:42%
Your mustache has yarn
connecting different --

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:23.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Connected to other parts.
-Yeah.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.771 line:92%
-And someone goes, "Oh, my gosh.

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's a map of El Camino!"
-Yeah.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's how you solve it.
-That's right.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:29.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, we've given away
the film now.

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:32.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. You know,
you can skip it.

